# NOITE's sauna (3fsauna): a right click plays the attendant once and his
# wave (GLOBO2.WAV, 1.415 s), whose end launches the real SAUNA; NOITE
# gets 0x40c at 3965 and hides. The moves are `tools/sauna_plan.py --scene
# 3fsauna --prefix FILE --start 4100` (FILE: the right click below; the
# ghosts' rand seed is SAUNA's start time, so this game is not
# sauna-alone-win.input's): 53 arrows and 2 clicks, no ghost met. SAUNA eats
# the last peanut and reports won 10600 (9600 + 1000); NOITE shows itself,
# adds it and at 26420 goes to the hall (3fhall) with its 3 lives, in
# both versions.
#
# The `--fix all,-sauna_arcade_rules,-sauna_controls_screen` run is the bug fixes on the
# 1995 rules; the Corrigida's arcade game has its own scripts, sauna-corrigida-*.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3fsauna --ms 28000 --input tools/play/sauna-3fsauna-win.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3fsauna --ms 28000 --fix all,-sauna_arcade_rules,-sauna_controls_screen --input tools/play/sauna-3fsauna-win.input
